@startuml sharding-booking
title Booking — шардирование по guest_id + shard_id в booking_id

left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor "Gateway\n(create / my bookings)" as gw
actor "Kafka consumer\npayment.captured\ninventory.released" as kafka

rectangle "Booking Service" as bkg {
  component "Create path\nshard = hash(guest_id)\nbooking_id = ULID + shard_id" as create
  component "Lookup by booking_id\nextract shard_id → route" as lookup
}

database "Shard 0\nPostgreSQL" as s0
database "Shard 1\nPostgreSQL" as s1
database "Shard N-1\nPostgreSQL" as sn

gw --> create : POST /bookings\n(guest from JWT)
create --> s0
create --> s1
create --> sn

kafka --> lookup : booking_id in event
lookup --> s0
lookup --> s1
lookup --> sn

note bottom of create
  **Почему guest_id**
  Основной read: «мои брони» —
  один шард, без scatter-gather.

  **Lookup без directory**
  Payment/Inventory шлют booking_id;
  shard_id зашит в id → O(1) route.
end note

note right of sn
  Trade-off: «все брони property X»
  (support / partner) →
  scatter-gather или
  отдельный read-model позже.

  Hotspot B2B/OTA-аккаунт:
  отдельный шард / дробный ключ.
end note

@enduml
